    "lawCode": "Amd §§1676 & 1680, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5436\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the public authorities law, in relation to providing\nfor the financing and construction of capital facilities for a certain\nnot-for-profit corporation\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nTo allow the inclusion of an educational institution in the\nPublic/Private Partnership program administered by the New York State\nDormitory Authority.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nSection 1 amends paragraph (b) of subdivision 2 of section 1676 of the\npublic authorities law, and Section 2 amends section 1680 of such law\nto add Fordham Preparatory School Inc to the list of educational\ninstitutions eligible for financing through the dormitory authority.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nSections 1676 and 1680 of the public authorities law contain the names\nof specific educational institutions that are authorized to receive\nassistance from the New York State Dormitory Authority. Without\ninclusion in this listing, an education institution does not qualify\nfor such assistance. This bill will authorize Fordham Preparatory\nSchool Inc.  to be included in the Public/Private Partnership program\nthat is administered by the Dormitory Authority in order to most\neffectively finance the construction of new science and other\neducational facilities at its existing location.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
